{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>"Hah... hah... </STYLE>Ryoji-kun<STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>"What's wrong? Side effects?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">After seeing something like that, of course... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
You<STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">did you do it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............ 
{PAUSE ""}
Yeah..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "リファレンス専用\SE\outo1一瞬.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Ugh!"</STYLE>
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"Hang in there! Should we go to the hospital?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Wh-what are you saying... If they did a blood test on me now..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"R-right..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Phew... Sorry, I've calmed down a little."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"It was a horrible sight. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">A girl about the same age as </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, her head fell off, and blood was gushing out. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Her father was frantically calling someone, and her mother was holding the headless girl and calling her name over and over."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I see..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"With this, we'll be saved, and so will </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah... That's right, exactly right."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What about </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1">? Are you okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Me... 
{PAUSE ""}
Yeah, I'm fine."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Come on, let's go back to the room, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Ryoji-kun<STYLE ID="1">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Go on ahead."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay."</STYLE><PG>
